  "outlookText": "150 \nACPN50 PHFO 062357\nTWOCP \n\nTropical Weather Outlook\nNWS Central Pacific Hurricane Center Honolulu HI\nIssued by NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL\n200 PM HST Fri Nov 06 2026\n\nFor the central North Pacific...between 140W and 180W:\n\nActive Systems:\nThe National Hurricane Center is issuing advisories on newly formed\nTropical Storm Pena, located several hundred miles southeast of the\nBig Island of Hawaii.\n\nTropical cyclone formation is not expected during the next 7 days.\n\n&&\nPublic Advisories on Tropical Storm Pena are issued under\nWMO header WTPA34 PHFO and under AWIPS header HFOTCPCP4.\nForecast/Advisories on Tropical Storm Pena are issued under\nWMO header WTPA24 PHFO and under AWIPS header HFOTCMCP4.\n\n$$\nForecaster Evans/Blake\nNNNN",
